  "notes": "Race Horses is an idle racing game from Gorilla Grafters, released on Roblox in June 2026. You buy eggs, hatch horses with random coats, eye sizes and traits, and enter them in a race that starts every minute. Any horse can win, but better horses earn more cash, which you spend on more eggs and stable upgrades. Your stable keeps earning while you are offline.\n\nCodes give horse food such as Carrots, Beetroot, Pineapples, Pumpkins and Golden Apples. Caring for your horses gives them bonus XP, and Golden Apples seem to be the most valuable treat since codes only hand out one at a time, so save them for your best horse. New codes arrive with updates and seasonal events and are posted in the game's Discord.",
